<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-10-21T18:48:20.119Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:48:20 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthis have intensified missile and blast strikes, killing 73 security recruits at a camp and hitting a military camp in Aden, while also targeting airports in Aden and Mukalla and a besieged city the UN says is at grave risk. The United Kingdom is deploying Typhoon fighter jets and other air assets to protect Saudi Arabia from further Houthi attacks, and Saudi Arabia has postponed a major investment conference because of the strikes. Egypt’s president says Egypt would defend Saudi territory but will not attack Yemen. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cv0ld6lrr2zeo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNa3ppLXJIWGl3SXd1QUhvbXBlUHZfU2UtY0JLeUltSmM0STd6a2hmdHRxTWFJNVJwM2lLbGFPMVNtd05xbEsyWm9tSDBHV2MtZ0dUaDZSZ2RjMG9reGJneTZJY1hFb1RwY0NpejRGcTNuYnRTTUlSd3gzNjFyV21MZWxiSUJEMnNfckdCZm9TelNPZlRvM2FGUHhpTjFEMzdjbUhtbkpmNEpXc0pvU1Y4S0oxejdfNXQ30gG-AUFVX3lxTE1ydTJoRG4yQnFMWk9aazN2WURlbUxHQURha2ZiMUN4cUE5dS0temwweWpDb1dNRURUNjJmNkp3SlczM3R6dUpjSkxZTnpmRnpvYWVmOHhRdUFOdmxpR19VcTNfNk9uTWRMZ0tfUWMtUXUwQ2pZLVVKT2Z1QUh6dl9RZlRzODJVMVpnU09semNEM2pOQUFUbi1ZRWZzckdHZUw0d3Awa2R4NmxFbTVaWFFvOTdmalotNHQwR0FjUXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPaTVZLWNRalc0ZzFmaXlERE8ySDhISTVTVjV0c0o2ZzU1UThTS2RMd0RRaVlsdmlNcFZfR3BiRHAwejM0dGFaUVA2V2JtVW4zMFZUVm1JMnViVGI1M2ZQa2VySHo2M3pJemxlRmJBanJSOTgwZko5VjFoeEFpTndNRHF4TGZNT25MMmRTMDRDdENwa3ZsZ1ZkY2NGOUo4a04wNmMxNk5OUE5nSXQ1TWxuZTNsQWF6U1JuX0FHcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxNTVYyVms3cUx5